# Web Development

We build bespoke web experiences focused on performance, accessibility and SEO.

## What we deliver

- High-converting landing pages
- Institutional sites with integrated CMS
- Web applications (SPA / SSR) using Astro, Next.js, Svelte
- API and database integrations

We work with **Cloudflare**, **Vercel** and **AWS** for scalable hosting.
